  "approach": "Resolve IAuditTrailService (not the unregistered concrete class) via GetRequiredService in MauiProgram; add PurgeOlderThanAsync to that interface; add Settings.AuditRetentionYears (1-7, default 1) via EF migration, validated in SettingsService/SetupService, surfaced in the setup wizard and Settings General tab, and mirrored into the backup DTO.",
